Scoring 3 kills with Heat Weapons or <primary/>Primary Weapons within 4 seconds of each grants 'Room Cleaning' for 10 seconds.

The buff grants 40 Grenade and 40 Weapons, as well as 40 Ammo Generation for Heat Weapons and <primary/>Primary Weapons.

// The source names the buff Room Cleaning, although the set bonus is named Room Clearing.
